    "description": "Big, bold & minimal watch face for Wear OS, displaying the most frequented timing information at a glance.\r\n\r\nThe watch face presents you with 3 styles and 50+ handpicked color palettes to match your everyday styling.\r\n\r\n\u2022 Built with Watch Face Format.\r\n\u2022 Supports watches running on Wear OS 4 or higher.\r\n\u2022 Clean, Bold & Battery Efficient.\r\n\u2022 50+ handpicked color palettes.\r\n\r\nFacing issues? don't hesitate to drop us a mail at support@sparkine.com",
